      "audioUrl": "audio/frank_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_01.mp3",
      "text": "Heard you hunt monsters.",
      "duration": 2.114
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "character": "Grey talon",
      "audioFile": "orion_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/orion_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_02.mp3",
      "text": "I do.",
      "duration": 0.77
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Victor",
      "audioFile": "frank_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/frank_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_03.mp3",
      "text": "Literally or figuratively.",
      "duration": 1.834
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "character": "Grey talon",
      "audioFile": "orion_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_04",
      "audioUrl": "audio/orion_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_04.mp3",
      "text": "It used to be literal.  Then I retired. Now it's more figurative.",
      "duration": 4.793
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "character": "Victor",
      "audioFile": "frank_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_05",
      "audioUrl": "audio/frank_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_05.mp3",
      "text": "So you just murder people.",
      "duration": 1.56
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "character": "Grey talon",
      "audioFile": "orion_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_06",
      "audioUrl": "audio/orion_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_06.mp3",
      "text": "That's a little reductive.",
      "duration": 1.378
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "character": "Victor",
      "audioFile": "frank_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_07",
      "audioUrl": "audio/frank_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_07.mp3",
      "text": "is it?",
      "duration": 0.687
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "character": "Grey talon",
      "audioFile": "orion_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_08",
      "audioUrl": "audio/orion_match_start_frank_orion_convo03_08.mp3",
      "text": "Yes.",
      "duration": 0.534
    }
